@API3_BACKEND_HostAddress = http://localhost:5289

### Search transactions
GET {{API3_BACKEND_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/search?page=1&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json

###

### Search by merchant within a date range
GET {{API3_BACKEND_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/search?page=1&pageSize=25&merchant=Savanna&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-11-01
Accept: application/json

###
